{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20538","headline":"朝日勅赐百官樱桃 · 张籍","name":"朝日勅赐百官樱桃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙果人间都未有，今朝忽见下天门。\n捧盘小吏初宣勅，当殿羣臣共拜恩。\n日色遥分门下坐，露香才出禁中园。\n每年重此先偏待，愿得千春奉至尊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}